# Shattering Stars (jeuno 132) available, a level 66 Warrior, the level cap alone either side of 70 (a GM's
# setLevelCap): cap 69 and cap 71: no section (no other limit break answers), MAAT_DIALOG; cap 70: 92 (1) (begun).
lists RuludeGardens/Maat/onTrigger RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/92
char zone=RuludeGardens pos=12.4,3.1,119.5 job=WAR lvl=66
levelcap 69
login
trigger Maat                            # cap 69: no section; MAAT_DIALOG
levelcap 71                             # a GM
trigger Maat                            # cap 71: no section; MAAT_DIALOG
levelcap 70                             # a GM
trigger Maat                            # cap 70: 92 (1)
finish                                  # begun
